	(text "LED wing + IR illuminator gate drivers, Arduino UNO Q GPIOs -> IRLZ44N low-side switches\nEach channel: GPIO -> 220-330R series gate resistor -> IRLZ44N gate (logic-level, low-side switch);\n10k pulldown holds the gate off before firmware init; MOSFET source -> GND bus; drain -> load return."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 50 40 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
		(uuid "fd9ec615-dfc7-47f4-8d6e-9cc5e883d4b4")
	)
	(text "D3/D6: real bench-confirmed 2-wing build (31 Aug 2026) - each wing mixes white+blue LEDs on one MOSFET.\nNot the aspirational 4-channel (white/blue x left/right) redesign - that needs D8/D9 and is not yet in config.h."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 50 215 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
		(uuid "70d6d77a-eba6-40e8-a446-239160e9e499")
	)
	(text "D7 IR gate: IRLZ44N shown, or the pre-built LR7843 screw-terminal module already in hand -\nsame gate-resistor + pulldown pattern either way. IR board has NO input voltage range, fixed 12V spec only,\nhence its own dedicated buck (U2) separate from the LED buck (U1)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 170 175 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
		(uuid "4ad1e5a4-b87c-469b-a017-4ea40f6ef0ed")
	)
	(text "Horn amp-enable (D11/PB15, same IRLZ44N pattern on the amp's GND return) is a separate\ncircuit, not shown here - see hardware/WIRING_GUIDE.md section 3."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 50 230 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
		(uuid "65b1e258-2448-4799-be6c-839da01cf26e")
	)
	(text "Battery bus: 4S LiFePO4, 12.8V nominal / 14.6V absorption peak, downstream of a 6A fuse + SPST switch.\nMultimeter-verify each XL4015 output with no load connected before wiring the downstream board."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 170 22 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
		(uuid "d5032893-8d2a-42e0-bc33-97521a44deba")
	)
